TITLE: Who may complete tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
The task's own person (without manager rights), a task manager, an administrator and a wall tablet token can complete a task; another user on a phone gets HTTP 403 with a Dutch message and the task stays open. The own person still cannot edit the task.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_task_completion.py
